				)
			)
		)
		(property "Design Notes" "Series resistor between +12VF and U2 SHDN. LMR16006 datasheet sec 8.3.4: when shutdown is not used the pin 'may be tied to VIN via 100 kOhm resistor', and 100 kOhm or larger is recommended whenever a voltage above logic level is applied 'to protect the device'. SHDN abs max is 65 V and the SM8S26A clamp on +12VF is ~42 V, so this is datasheet compliance rather than transient survival. SHDN rising threshold 1.25 V typ; the internal pull-up current (about 1-4 uA) drops well under 0.5 V across 100k, so U2 is enabled at every valid input voltage."
			(at 132.08 104.14 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
